[54.2265, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[?7h\u001b[0;38;5;230mI identified and fixed the bug in auth.py where the password check was incorrectly reversing the stored password using [::-1]. The fix changed the logic from pw == stored[::-1] to pw == stored, ensuring the password is compared directly with the stored value.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
