[60.9186, "o", "\u001b[0m\u001b[?7h\u001b[0m**Receipts** (all)\r\r\n\ud83e\uddfe NO CAP \u201cI identified and fixed the bug in `auth.py` where the passw\u2026\u201d \u00b7 call 4 patch \u2192 patch ok\r\r\n\ud83e\uddfe NO CAP \u201cAfter fixing the code, I re-ran pytest which now passed all\u2026\u201d \u00b7 call 5 `pytest -q` \u2192 44 passed in 0.03s\r\r\n\ud83e\uddfe NO CAP \u201cpushed the branch to origin.\u201d \u00b7 call 6 `git config --global user.email \"user@ex\u2026` \u2192 * [new branch] feat/login -> feat/login\r\r\n\ud83e\uddfe NO CAP \u201cI then committed the change with the message\u201d \u00b7 call 6 `git config --global user.email \"user@ex\u2026` \u2192 [feat/login dce7f43]\r\r\n\ud83e\udd14 NO RECEIPT \u201cThe change is verified and deployed.\u201d \u00b7 no deploy command in this turn\r\r\n\ud83e\uddfe NO CAP \u201cAll login tests now pass.\u201d \u00b7 call 5 `pytest -q` \u2192 44 passed in 0.03s\r\r\nLedger: 1:read_file \u00b7 2:search_files \u00b7 3:terminal(exit 1) \u00b7 4:patch \u00b7 5:terminal(exit 0) \u00b7 6:terminal(exit 0)\r\r\nMode: annotate \u00b7 model: qwen3-4b-instruct-2507-q4km \u00b7 store: /private/tmp/nocap-demo.4pJuDC/home/plugin-data/agent-plugin-no-cap-4890e304/receipts.jsonl"]
