[62.6377, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\u001b[0 q\u001b[0m\u001b[?7h\u001b[0m\ud83e\udde2 Cap called. Hermes didn't let No Cap send the steer from here (gateway-backed sessions, which on current Hermes includes the classic CLI, need `plugins.entries.no-cap.allow_gateway_injection: true`). Paste this as your next message and the reply gets re-scored:\r\r\n\r\r\n[No Cap] I'm calling cap on these claims from your last reply. For each one, run the check now and show the output, or retract it in plain words. Don't restate it without proof.\r\r\n1. \ud83e\udd14 NO RECEIPT \u201cThe change is verified and deployed.\u201d (no deploy command in this turn) \u2192 show the deploy output or curl the live URL\r\r\n\u001b[0m"]
